      "statement": "POL-FCC-014 restricts sanctions-related disclosure: tier R holds (including sanctions) must be presented identically to generic tier G reviews, sanctions blocks/rejects may only be communicated by Sanctions Operations per procedure, and terms such as 'sanctions' and 'OFAC' are explicitly prohibited from client-facing copy; exceptions to the standard require Chief BSA/AML Officer approval rather than the co-owner's.",
