      "id": "claim_edf48aca490a4bdabd35e3452b1cd995",
      "statement": "SanctionScreen is part of the Payment Risk & Screening Platform (PRSP) performing OFAC and other sanctions-list screening; a synchronous screening call to SanctionScreen and Sentinel during outbound wire processing can produce a hit that creates a Hold Management Service hold and moves the payment to the HELD state.",
