      "statement": "There is currently no client-facing interface to Hold Management Service hold data; a proposed Client-Safe Hold Status Facade (FCT-1893) was deprioritized in 2025-Q3, so any SanctionScreen-driven hold status exposed to clients in the future would need to satisfy POL-FCC-014's tier-R rules.",
